    "content": `<section class="pp-sec " id="overview"><div class="wrap"><div class="ov"><div><div class="sec-h left rv"><div class="eyebrow">What it covers</div><h2>Impersonation moves faster than your marketing team can</h2></div><div class="ov-pts"><div class="ov-pt rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/><path d="M16.2 7.8a6 6 0 010 8.4M7.8 16.2a6 6 0 010-8.4M19.1 4.9a10 10 0 010 14.2M4.9 19.1a10 10 0 010-14.2"/></svg></span><div><h4>Coverage that matches the threat</h4><p>Social platforms, app stores, domain registrations, marketplaces, paste sites and search ads, watched continuously.</p></div></div><div class="ov-pt rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M17 11l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><div><h4>Verified, not just detected</h4><p>Agents score each hit for intent and reach; analysts confirm before you are asked to act.</p></div></div><div class="ov-pt rv" style="--d:0.2s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 4l6 6-8 8-6-6 8-8z"/><path d="M2 22l6-6M15 5l4 4"/></svg></span><div><h4>Detection to removal</h4><p>Every confirmed case flows into XcellSecure Takedown with platform-specific evidence already packaged.</p></div></div></div></div>
<div class="ov-panel rv tilt" style="--d:.2s"><h4>What's included</h4><div class="pm">EVERY PLAN \xB7 MANAGED BY XCELLHOST</div><ul><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Social media impersonation detection</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Phishing-domain and cloned-page detection</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Rogue mobile app monitoring across official and third-party stores</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Executive impersonation and deepfake detection</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Counterfeit and marketplace listing monitoring</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Case management with evidence and takedown status</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec ice" id="how"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">How it works</div><h2>How a fake becomes a closed case</h2><p>Most impersonations are found within hours of going live and removed within two days.</p></div><div class="steps"><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.00s"><span class="n">01</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 15s1-1 4-1 5 2 8 2 4-1 4-1V3s-1 1-4 1-5-2-8-2-4 1-4 1z"/><path d="M4 22v-7"/></svg></span><h3>Register</h3><p>Tell us your brands, logos, executives and official handles.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.12s"><span class="n">02</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/><path d="M16.2 7.8a6 6 0 010 8.4M7.8 16.2a6 6 0 010-8.4M19.1 4.9a10 10 0 010 14.2M4.9 19.1a10 10 0 010-14.2"/></svg></span><h3>Watch</h3><p>Agents scan 26 channel types continuously for lookalikes and abuse.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.24s"><span class="n">03</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M17 11l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h3>Verify</h3><p>Each hit is scored for intent and reach, then confirmed by an analyst.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.36s"><span class="n">04</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 4l6 6-8 8-6-6 8-8z"/><path d="M2 22l6-6M15 5l4 4"/></svg></span><h3>Act</h3><p>Confirmed cases go to takedown with evidence attached; you get the outcome.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec " id="features"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">Key features</div><h2>Six kinds of brand abuse, one console</h2></div><div class="grid3"><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></svg></span><h3>Social impersonation</h3><p>Fake profiles, support accounts and pages on Facebook, Instagram, X, LinkedIn, YouTube, Telegram and WhatsApp.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M2 12h20M12 2a15 15 0 010 20M12 2a15 15 0 000 20"/></svg></span><h3>Phishing domains and pages</h3><p>Lookalike registrations, cloned login pages and credential-harvesting kits that use your brand.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.2s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M12 18h.01"/></svg></span><h3>Rogue mobile apps</h3><p>Copycat and repackaged apps on official stores and the third-party APK sites where most fraud starts.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"/></svg></span><h3>Deepfakes and executive impersonation</h3><p>Synthetic video and voice of your leadership used in scams, investment pitches and payment requests.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="21" r="1"/><circle cx="20" cy="21" r="1"/><path d="M1 1h4l2.7 13.4a2 2 0 002 1.6h9.7a2 2 0 002-1.6L23 6H6"/></svg></span><h3>Counterfeits and marketplaces</h3><p>Fake listings, unauthorised sellers and brand misuse on e-commerce and classifieds platforms.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.2s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"/></svg></span><h3>Search ads and SEO abuse</h3><p>Paid ads and pages that hijack your brand keywords to redirect customers.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec ice" id="benefits"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">Benefits</div><h2>What protection means for the business</h2></div><div class="grid2"><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></svg></span><div><h4>Fewer defrauded customers</h4><p>Find fakes before customers do; fewer chargebacks, refunds and complaints.</p></div></div><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"/><path d="M8.2 13.9L7 23l5-3 5 3-1.2-9.1"/></svg></span><div><h4>Reputation stays yours</h4><p>Executive deepfakes and fake announcements are caught before they spread.</p></div></div><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg></span><div><h4>Days, not months</h4><p>Takedown-ready evidence cuts platform response from weeks to about 48 hours.</p></div></div><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8l-6-6z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg></span><div><h4>Legal-grade records</h4><p>Timestamped captures and case files ready for police complaints and legal action.</p></div></div><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15l4-4 4 3 5-6"/></svg></span><div><h4>Board-level visibility</h4><p>Trends by channel and severity, so leadership sees the risk and the results.</p></div></div><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 18v-6a9 9 0 0118 0v6"/><path d="M21 19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1a2 2 0 01-2-2v-3a2 2 0 012-2h3zM3 19a2 2 0 002 2h1a2 2 0 002-2v-3a2 2 0 00-2-2H3z"/></svg></span><div><h4>Analysts, not just alerts</h4><p>XcellHost analysts verify hits and handle the escalations with platforms.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec " id="outcomes"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">Before and after</div><h2>Before and after Brand Intelligence</h2></div><div class="ba rv"><div class="ba-h"><div>What changes</div><div>Before</div><div class="a">With XcellSecure</div></div><div class="ba-r"><div class="m">Fake pages and apps</div><div class="b"><i></i>Found when a customer is defrauded</div><div class="a"><i></i>Found within hours of going live</div></div><div class="ba-r"><div class="m">Executive impersonation</div><div class="b"><i></i>Handled ad hoc by whoever noticed</div><div class="a"><i></i>Monitored and escalated automatically</div></div><div class="ba-r"><div class="m">Takedowns</div><div class="b"><i></i>Weeks of emails to platforms</div><div class="a"><i></i>Filed with evidence; average 48 hours</div></div><div class="ba-r"><div class="m">Evidence for legal action</div><div class="b"><i></i>Screenshots in inboxes</div><div class="a"><i></i>Timestamped case files</div></div><div class="