="0"><rect class="hb" x="120" y="455" width="360" height="22" rx="6" fill="rgba(4,30,66,.7)" stroke="#F87171" stroke-opacity=".7"/><circle cx="138" cy="466" r="9" fill="#F87171"/><g transform="translate(131.4,459.4) scale(0.55)" fill="none" stroke="#041E42" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M15 9l-6 6M9 9l6 6"/></g><text x="156" y="470" fill="#F87171" font-size="8.5" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-weight="700" text-anchor="start" >BLOCKED</text><text x="470" y="470" fill="#B9C8E4" font-size="8" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-weight="500" text-anchor="end" >\u20B92,40,000 \xB7 new payee \xB7 03:14 IST</text></g><g class="hot" data-i="4" tabindex="0"><rect class="hb" x="120" y="481" width="360" height="22" rx="6" fill="rgba(4,30,66,.7)" stroke="#F87171" stroke-opacity=".7"/><circle cx="138" cy="492" r="9" fill="#F87171"/><g transform="translate(131.4,485.4) scale(0.55)" fill="none" stroke="#041E42" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></g><text x="156" y="496" fill="#F87171" font-size="8.5" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-weight="700" text-anchor="start" >ACCOUNT FROZEN</text><text x="470" y="496" fill="#B9C8E4" font-size="8" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-weight="500" text-anchor="end" >mule pattern \xB7 a/c \xB7\xB7\xB74417 \u2192 \xB7\xB7\xB79920</text></g><line x1="300" y1="360" x2="300" y2="378" stroke="rgba(138,180,255,.3)"/><text x="576" y="40" fill="#4ADE80" font-size="8.5" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-weight="500" text-anchor="end" >0.4% false declines \xB7 24\xD77 desk</text><text x="300" y="508" fill="#7F94BB" font-size="8" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-weight="500" text-anchor="middle" >the whole sequence scored \u2014 takeover, payee change and payout \u2014 not each event alone</text></svg></div><div class="an-glow"></div><div class="an-info" id="anInfo"><div class="ih"><span class="ni c-risk"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><div><b>Approved</b><span>Decision</span></div></div><p>Low-risk transactions from known devices and regular payees clear instantly, keeping checkout and payments fast for good customers.</p><div class="im"><div><b><200 ms</b><span>decision</span></div><div><b>0.4%</b><span>false decline</span></div><div><b>Instant</b><span>clear</span></div></div><a href="#" style="display:none">Open <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div><div class="an-tick" id="anTick"><i></i><span>Approved \xB7 \u20B98,499 \xB7 known device \xB7 regular payee</span></div></div>',
    "content": `<section class="pp-sec " id="overview"><div class="wrap"><div class="ov"><div><div class="sec-h left rv"><div class="eyebrow">What it covers</div><h2>Fraud is a sequence, not a single event</h2></div><div class="ov-pts"><div class="ov-pt rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg></span><div><h4>Real-time transaction scoring</h4><p>Every login, payee change and payout is scored in under 200 ms on device, behaviour, velocity and network signals.</p></div></div><div class="ov-pt rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 007 0l3-3a5 5 0 00-7-7l-1 1"/><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 00-7 0l-3 3a5 5 0 007 7l1-1"/></svg></span><div><h4>Cross-signal correlation</h4><p>Account, payment and device events are stitched into one risk picture, so takeover-then-payout chains are caught.</p></div></div><div class="ov-pt rv" style="--d:0.2s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M17 11l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><div><h4>Analyst-reviewed decisions</h4><p>High-risk and borderline cases go to the XcellHost fraud desk, cutting false declines while keeping fraud out.</p></div></div></div></div>
<div class="ov-panel rv tilt" style="--d:.2s"><h4>What's included</h4><div class="pm">EVERY PLAN \xB7 MANAGED BY XCELLHOST</div><ul><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Real-time transaction and payment scoring</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Account-takeover and session-anomaly detection</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Mule-account and payout-network detection</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Device fingerprinting and velocity checks</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Configurable rules and risk thresholds</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Case management with analyst review</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec ice" id="how"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">How it works</div><h2>How a transaction is decided</h2><p>Connected to your systems by API; decisions return in milliseconds.</p></div><div class="steps"><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.00s"><span class="n">01</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"/><path d="M21 12c0 1.7-4 3-9 3s-9-1.3-9-3M3 5v14c0 1.7 4 3 9 3s9-1.3 9-3V5"/></svg></span><h3>Ingest</h3><p>Login, payee, payment and device events stream in from your apps and payment stack.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.12s"><span class="n">02</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg></span><h3>Score</h3><p>A risk score is computed in under 200 ms from device, behaviour, velocity and network signals.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.24s"><span class="n">03</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l8 3v6c0 5.5-3.5 9.7-8 11-4.5-1.3-8-5.5-8-11V5l8-3z"/></svg></span><h3>Decide</h3><p>Approve, step-up (OTP/2FA), hold or block \u2014 against thresholds you control.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.36s"><span class="n">04</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M17 11l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h3>Review</h3><p>Grey-area and high-value cases go to the fraud desk; feedback tunes the model.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec " id="features"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">Key features</div><h2>What the fraud engine watches</h2></div><div class="grid3"><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6 3h12M6 8h12M6 13a4 4 0 004-4 4 4 0 00-4-4M6 13l8 8"/></svg></span><h3>Payment fraud scoring</h3><p>Scores every payout on amount, payee history, timing and channel to stop unauthorised and redirected payments.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 2l-2 2m-7.6 7.6a5.5 5.5 0 11-7.8 7.8 5.5 5.5 0 017.8-7.8zm0 0L19 3m-4 4l3 3"/></svg></span><h3>Account-takeover detection</h3><p>Correlates risky logins with immediate payee or payout changes \u2014 the classic takeover-then-drain pattern.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.2s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></svg></span><h3>Mule-network detection</h3><p>Graphs money movement to surface mule accounts and coordinated payout rings.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M12 18h.01"/></svg></span><h3>Device and behaviour signals</h3><p>Device fingerprinting, typing and navigation patterns and velocity checks separate the customer from the attacker.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 00-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"/><path d="M13.7 21a2 2 0 01-3.4 0"/></svg></span><h3>Step-up and hold actions</h3><p>Trigger OTP, 2FA, a hold or a block automatically based on the score, not a blunt all-or-nothing rule.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.2s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15l4-4 4 3 5-6"/></svg></span><h3>Rules and analytics</h3><p>Build and test rules, watch approval and fraud rates, and see the trend by channel and segment.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec ice" id="benefits"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">Benefits</div><h2>What Fraud Protection protects</h2></div><div class="grid2"><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M15 9l-6 6M9 9l6 6"/></svg></span><div><h4>Less fraud loss</h4><p>Stop unauthorised payouts and takeover-driven drains before settlement.</p></div></div><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><div><h4>Fewer false declines</h4><p>Analyst review and behavioural scoring approve good customers a blunt rule would reject.</p></div></div><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg></span><div><h4>Decisions in milliseconds</h4><p>Real-time scoring keeps checkout and payment flows fast.</p></div></div><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></svg></span><div><h4>Break mule rings</h4><p>Network analysis surfaces coordinated fraud, not just single events.</p></div></div><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-