    "content": `<section class="pp-sec " id="overview"><div class="wrap"><div class="ov"><div><div class="sec-h left rv"><div class="eyebrow">What it covers</div><h2>Most breaches start with a click. Change the click.</h2></div><div class="ov-pts"><div class="ov-pt rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"/><path d="M9 1v3M15 1v3M9 20v3M15 20v3M1 9h3M1 15h3M20 9h3M20 15h3"/></svg></span><div><h4>AI-written simulations</h4><p>Campaigns are generated from current lures, your brand and your departments, so nobody recognises a template.</p></div></div><div class="ov-pt rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 17H20"/><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 014 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 2z"/></svg></span><div><h4>Training that lands</h4><p>A three-minute lesson at the moment of the mistake, in the user\u2019s language, beats an annual hour of slides.</p></div></div><div class="ov-pt rv" style="--d:0.2s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15l4-4 4 3 5-6"/></svg></span><div><h4>A risk score you can act on</h4><p>Every user, team and site has a live score built from simulations, reporting behaviour and exposure.</p></div></div></div></div>
<div class="ov-panel rv tilt" style="--d:.2s"><h4>What's included</h4><div class="pm">EVERY PLAN \xB7 MANAGED BY XCELLHOST</div><ul><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>AI phishing simulations by email, SMS and WhatsApp</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Micro-training library in English, Hindi and six other Indian languages</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Report-a-phish button for Outlook and Gmail</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Human-risk score per user, team and location</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Executive and whaling simulations</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Compliance and board reporting</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec ice" id="how"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">How it works</div><h2>How the programme runs</h2><p>Set up in a day. First campaign the same week.</p></div><div class="steps"><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.00s"><span class="n">01</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></svg></span><h3>Onboard</h3><p>Sync users from Microsoft 365, Google Workspace or Zoho People; group by team and site.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.12s"><span class="n">02</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M3 7l9 6 9-6"/></svg></span><h3>Simulate</h3><p>AI-written campaigns go out on a cadence you choose, across email, SMS and WhatsApp.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.24s"><span class="n">03</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 17H20"/><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 014 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 2z"/></svg></span><h3>Train</h3><p>Anyone who clicks gets a three-minute lesson immediately; everyone gets a monthly one.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.36s"><span class="n">04</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15l4-4 4 3 5-6"/></svg></span><h3>Measure</h3><p>Risk scores update continuously; leadership sees click and report rates by team.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec " id="features"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">Key features</div><h2>Everything a modern awareness programme needs</h2></div><div class="grid3"><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"/><path d="M9 1v3M15 1v3M9 20v3M15 20v3M1 9h3M1 15h3M20 9h3M20 15h3"/></svg></span><h3>AI phishing simulation</h3><p>Fresh lures built from current campaigns targeting Indian businesses, in your brand voice, across email, SMS and WhatsApp.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 17H20"/><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 014 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 2z"/></svg></span><h3>Micro-training library</h3><p>Short lessons in eight Indian languages on phishing, passwords, payments fraud, data handling and DPDP basics.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.2s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 00-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"/><path d="M13.7 21a2 2 0 01-3.4 0"/></svg></span><h3>Report-a-phish button</h3><p>One click in Outlook or Gmail sends suspicious mail to the XcellHost SOC for triage, with feedback to the user.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15l4-4 4 3 5-6"/></svg></span><h3>Human-risk scoring</h3><p>A live score per user, team and site from simulation results, reporting behaviour and exposure data.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></svg></span><h3>Executive and whaling simulations</h3><p>Targeted scenarios for finance, HR and leadership, the people attackers actually study.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.2s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" strok