0+ platform paths \xB7 evidence accepted \xB7 re-detection</text></g><g transform="translate(346,86)"><circle r="28" fill="none" stroke="rgba(138,180,255,.2)" stroke-width="6"/><circle r="28" fill="none" stroke="#4ADE80" stroke-width="6" pathLength="100" stroke-dasharray="64 100" transform="rotate(-90)"><animate attributeName="stroke-dasharray" values="0 100;64 100" dur="2.4s" fill="freeze"/></circle><text x="0" y="4" fill="#fff" font-size="11" font-family="Sora, sans-serif" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" >26 h</text><text x="0" y="46" fill="#B9C8E4" font-size="7.5" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-weight="500" text-anchor="middle" >median removal</text></g><text x="24" y="500" fill="#7F94BB" font-size="8.5" font-family="IBM Plex Mono, monospace" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start" >one validated case \xB7 platform-specific evidence \xB7 chased to removal</text></svg></div><div class="an-glow"></div><div class="an-info" id="anInfo"><div class="ih"><span class="ni c-brand"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l8 3v6c0 5.5-3.5 9.7-8 11-4.5-1.3-8-5.5-8-11V5l8-3z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><div><b>Abuse validated</b><span>Stage 1</span></div></div><p>Computer vision matches the logo and layout, NLP reads the lure, redirect checks confirm intent. Confidence scoring keeps legitimate partners safe.</p><div class="im"><div><b>98%</b><span>brand match</span></div><div><b>Phishing</b><span>class</span></div><div><b>Auto</b><span>approved</span></div></div><a href="#" style="display:none">Open <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a></div><div class="an-tick" id="anTick"><i></i><span>Validated \xB7 secure-login-paypa1.com \xB7 brand match 98% \xB7 phishing</span></div></div>',
    "content": `<section class="pp-sec " id="overview"><div class="wrap"><div class="ov"><div><div class="sec-h left rv"><div class="eyebrow">What it covers</div><h2>Finding a threat is half the job. Removing it is the other half.</h2></div><div class="ov-pts"><div class="ov-pt rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8l-6-6z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg></span><div><h4>Evidence that gets action</h4><p>Screenshots, HTML captures, WHOIS, hosting, trademark proof and policy references, formatted for each provider.</p></div></div><div class="ov-pt rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 2L11 13M22 2l-7 20-4-9-9-4 20-7z"/></svg></span><div><h4>Automated filing and follow-up</h4><p>Notices go out within minutes of confirmation, with reminders and escalation on the provider\u2019s own timelines.</p></div></div><div class="ov-pt rv" style="--d:0.2s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M23 4v6h-6M1 20v-6h6"/><path d="M3.5 9a9 9 0 0114.9-3.4L23 10M1 14l4.6 4.4A9 9 0 0020.5 15"/></svg></span><div><h4>Re-detection built in</h4><p>Removed threats that come back on a new host are matched, re-filed and tracked as the same case.</p></div></div></div></div>
<div class="ov-panel rv tilt" style="--d:.2s"><h4>What's included</h4><div class="pm">EVERY PLAN \xB7 MANAGED BY XCELLHOST</div><ul><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Phishing and fraud-site takedown</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Social media impersonation removal</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Rogue mobile app removal from official and third-party stores</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Leaked document and data removal requests</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Browser blocklisting through Safe Browsing and SmartScreen</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Case dashboard with SLA and outcome tracking</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec ice" id="how"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">How it works</div><h2>What happens after you say \u201Ctake it down\u201D</h2><p>Most cases close within 72 hours. You see every step in the case dashboard.</p></div><div class="steps"><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.00s"><span class="n">01</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="M21 21l-4.3-4.3"/></svg></span><h3>Detect</h3><p>A threat arrives from Brand Intelligence, Dark Web Monitoring or your own report.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.12s"><span class="n">02</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8l-6-6z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg></span><h3>Package</h3><p>Evidence is captured, timestamped and matched to the provider\u2019s abuse policy.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.24s"><span class="n">03</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 2L11 13M22 2l-7 20-4-9-9-4 20-7z"/></svg></span><h3>Notify</h3><p>Notices go to the host, registrar, platform or store, with browser blocklisting in parallel.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.36s"><span class="n">04</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l8 3v6c0 5.5-3.5 9.7-8 11-4.5-1.3-8-5.5-8-11V5l8-3z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h3>Remove</h3><p>We chase, escalate and confirm removal, then watch for the threat to return.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec " id="features"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">Key features</div><h2>Built to move providers, at scale</h2></div><div class="grid3"><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M2 12h20M12 2a15 15 0 010 20M12 2a15 15 0 000 20"/></svg></span><h3>Domains and hosting</h3><p>Registrar, host and CDN notices for phishing, fraud and lookalike domains, including bulletproof hosts through upstream escalation.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></svg></span><h3>Social accounts and pages</h3><p>Impersonation reports to Facebook, Instagram, X, LinkedIn, YouTube, Telegram and WhatsApp using verified-brand channels.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.2s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2"/><path d="M12 18h.01"/></svg></span><h3>Mobile apps</h3><p>Removal requests to Google Play, the Apple App Store and the third-party APK sites where most fraud starts.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M15 9l-6 6M9 9l6 6"/></svg></span><h3>Browser blocklisting</h3><p>Google Safe Browsing and Microsoft SmartScreen submissions that warn users while the takedown completes.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8l-6-6z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg></span><h3>Leaked content</h3><p>Removal of exposed documents, data and internal material from file hosts, forums and paste sites.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.2s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 4l6 6-8 8-6-6 8-8