    "content": `<section class="pp-sec " id="overview"><div class="wrap"><div class="ov"><div><div class="sec-h left rv"><div class="eyebrow">What it covers</div><h2>Your security is only as strong as the partner you forgot to check</h2></div><div class="ov-pts"><div class="ov-pt rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg></span><div><h4>External rating for every party</h4><p>Each third party gets a continuously updated security rating based on its real internet-facing posture and breach history.</p></div></div><div class="ov-pt rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8l-6-6z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg></span><div><h4>Evidence without the chase</h4><p>Questionnaires, certificates and policies are requested, collected and tracked automatically, with reminders that are not from you.</p></div></div><div class="ov-pt rv" style="--d:0.2s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l10 5-10 5L2 7l10-5z"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5M2 17l10 5 10-5"/></svg></span><div><h4>Tiering and concentration</h4><p>Third parties are tiered by data access and business criticality, with fourth-party and concentration risk mapped.</p></div></div></div></div>
<div class="ov-panel rv tilt" style="--d:.2s"><h4>What's included</h4><div class="pm">EVERY PLAN \xB7 MANAGED BY XCELLHOST</div><ul><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Third-party inventory with tiering and ownership</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Daily external security rating per party</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Breach and dark-web exposure alerts</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Automated questionnaires and evidence collection</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Concentration and fourth-party mapping</li><li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg></i>Portfolio dashboard and board report</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec ice" id="how"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">How it works</div><h2>From a vendor list to a governed portfolio</h2><p>Import your vendor list and you have a rated portfolio the same week.</p></div><div class="steps"><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.00s"><span class="n">01</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"/><path d="M21 12c0 1.7-4 3-9 3s-9-1.3-9-3M3 5v14c0 1.7 4 3 9 3s9-1.3 9-3V5"/></svg></span><h3>Import</h3><p>Upload vendors from your ERP, CRM or a spreadsheet; agents enrich each with domains and ownership.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.12s"><span class="n">02</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l10 5-10 5L2 7l10-5z"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5M2 17l10 5 10-5"/></svg></span><h3>Tier</h3><p>Each party is tiered by data access, integration depth and business impact.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.24s"><span class="n">03</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg></span><h3>Monitor</h3><p>External posture, breaches and compliance status are refreshed daily and scored.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.36s"><span class="n">04</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M17 11l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h3>Govern</h3><p>Owners get actions, vendors get remediation plans, leadership gets the portfolio grade.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec " id="features"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">Key features</div><h2>What Third Party Risk Monitoring covers</h2></div><div class="grid3"><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg></span><h3>Continuous security ratings</h3><p>Posture scores built from external scans, exposed services, email security and breach history, refreshed daily.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M10.3 3.9L1.8 18a2 2 0 001.7 3h17a2 2 0 001.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 00-3.4 0z"/><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01"/></svg></span><h3>Breach and exposure alerts</h3><p>Same-day alerts when a partner is breached, named on a leak site or leaks credentials, with your exposure mapped.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.2s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8l-6-6z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg></span><h3>Questionnaire automation</h3><p>Standard and custom questionnaires sent, tracked and scored, with evidence uploads and expiry reminders.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l10 5-10 5L2 7l10-5z"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5M2 17l10 5 10-5"/></svg></span><h3>Fourth-party and concentration risk</h3><p>See which critical services your vendors themselves depend on and where too much rides on one provider.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"/><path d="M8.2 13.9L7 23l5-3 5 3-1.2-9.1"/></svg></span><h3>Compliance evidence</h3><p>ISO 27001, SOC 2, PCI DSS and DPDP processor evidence tracked with validity dates.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.2s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15l4-4 4 3 5-6"/></svg></span><h3>Portfolio reporting</h3><p>Board-ready portfolio grade, trends, critical parties and remediation status.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec ice" id="benefits"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">Benefits</div><h2>What the business gets</h2></div><div class="grid2"><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg></span><div><h4>Know within a day</h4><p>Partner breaches reach you the same day, with the specific systems and data at risk.</p></div></div><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></svg></span><div><h4>Procurement without guesswork</h4><p>Onboarding checks give a rating before the contract is signed.</p></div></div><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8l-6-6z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg></span><div><h4>Evidence for regulators</h4><p>RBI outsourcing, SEBI and DPDP processor obligations documented continuously.</p></div></div><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2l10 5-10 5L2 7l10-5z"/><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5M2 17l10 5 10-5"/></svg></span><div><h4>Fewer single points of failure</h4><p>Concentration risk is visible before an outage or breach exposes it.</p></div></div><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><path d="M7 15l4-4 4 3 5-6"/></svg></span><div><h4>A board-level answer</h4><p>One grade, one trend, one list of what needs attention.</p></div></div><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 18v-6a9 9 0 0118 0v6"/><path d="M21 19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1a2 2 0 01-2-2v-3a2 2 0 012-2h3zM3 19a2 2 0 002 2h1a2 2 0 002-2v-3a2 2 0 00-2-2H3z"/></svg></span><div><h4>Analysts review the critical ones</h4><p>XcellHost analysts review high-risk parties and write the remediation plan.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec " id="outcomes"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">Before and after</div><h2>Before and after Third Party Risk Monitoring</h2></div><div class="ba rv"><div class="ba-h"><div>What changes</div><div>Before</div><div class="a">With XcellSecure</div></div><div class="ba-r"><div class="m">Risk assessments</div><div class="b"><i></i>Annual questionnaire, self-reported</div><div class="a"><i></i>Continuous, evidence-based</div></div><div class="ba-r"><div class="m">Breach at a partner</div><div class="b"><i></i>Learned from the news</div><div class="a"><i></i>Alerted the same day, impact mapped</div></div><div class="ba-r"><div class="m">Tiering and ownership</div><div class="b"><i></i>Undefined</div><div class="a"><i></i>Every third party tiered with a named owner</div></div><div class="ba-r"><div class="m">Board reporting</div><div class="b"><i></i>Manual slide deck</div><div class="a"><i></i>Live portfolio grade and trends</div></div><div class="ba-r"><div class="m">DPDP processor oversight</div><div class="b"><i></i>A clause in the contract</div><div class="a"><i></i>Monitored for real exposure</div></div></div><