M8 14h.01M12 14h.01M16 14h.01"/></svg></span><h3>Add</h3><p>Enter the vendor name and domain, or import from Zoho Books, Tally or SAP.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.12s"><span class="n">02</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg></span><h3>Score</h3><p>External posture is scanned and scored daily, with a trend from day one.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.24s"><span class="n">03</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 00-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"/><path d="M13.7 21a2 2 0 01-3.4 0"/></svg></span><h3>Track</h3><p>Certificates, policies and contract clauses are tracked with expiry reminders.</p></div><div class="step rv" style="--d:0.36s"><span class="n">04</span><span class="sn"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v16a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2V8l-6-6z"/><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h8"/></svg></span><h3>Review</h3><p>Vendors upload evidence; your team approves, procurement and audit export what they need.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec " id="features"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">Key features</div><h2>What Vendor Risk Monitoring tracks</h2></div><div class="grid3"><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg></span><h3>Daily posture scoring</h3><p>Exposed services, TLS hygiene, email authentication, patch signals and reputation, scored and trended daily.</p></div><div class="card tilt rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic