r.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="pp-sec ice" id="benefits"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-h rv"><div class="eyebrow">Benefits</div><h2>What continuous vendor monitoring gives you</h2></div><div class="grid2"><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M1 12s4-7 11-7 11 7 11 7-4 7-11 7S1 12 1 12z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></span><div><h4>No more expired certificates</h4><p>Expiry alerts at 60, 30 and 7 days keep compliance evidence current.</p></div></div><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M23 6l-9.5 9.5-5-5L1 18"/><path d="M17 6h6v6"/></svg></span><div><h4>Drift is visible</h4><p>A vendor whose posture is falling shows up before the incident does.</p></div></div><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 00-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 010 7.75"/></svg></span><div><h4>Procurement decides with data</h4><p>Score, history and open issues in one view at renewal time.</p></div></div><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.1s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg></span><div><h4>Audits in minutes</h4><p>Export vendor evidence and status instead of chasing emails for weeks.</p></div></div><div class="pp-ben rv" style="--d:0.0s"><span class="fic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoi